#: src-en/mod-appendix/metadata.xml:3
msgid "mod-appendix/metadata.xml$/dummyroot/metadata/title"
msgstr "Outer Expansion: Acidic Growth"

#: src-en/mod-appendix/metadata.xml:11
msgid "mod-appendix/metadata.xml$/dummyroot/metadata/description"
msgstr ""
"This mod adds the Acidic Growth to the depths of the multiverse.\n"
"The Acidic Growth is a hivemind/singular organism that has evolved in the nebula clouds at the edge of the galaxy. It's intelligence has enabled it to develop it's own technology such as weapons, ships, and even mechanical bodies to inhabit."
